<p>Aye Aspe Bawafa mera baba kaha'n gaya<br />
Aye Zuljana bata mera baba kaha'n gaya</p>

<p>1. Kyu'n khoo'n bhari hai zulfei'n kyun teer hai badan pa<br />
tewar bata rahei'n hai kuch to hua hai ran me<br />
tanha hai tu khada mera baba kaha'n gaya</p>

<p>2. Chup chaap kyu'n khada hai kuch bolta nahi hai<br />
Bechain hai phuphi bhi aansu baha rahi hai<br />
kuch to unhe bata mera baba kaha'n gaya</p>

<p>3. Maidaa'n se jab bhi aaya baba ko tu hai laaya<br />
is baar aye faras kyu'n sarwar(a.s) ko chordh aaya<br />
beti ko kuch bata mera baba kaha'n gaya</p>

<p>4. Rehwaar tune dekha jab tujhko maine roka<br />
waqte wida pidar ne seene pe tha sulaaya<br />
Ab soungi kaha'n mera baba kaha'n gaya</p>

<p>5. Lashe uthaaye tune ansaare shahe dee'n ke<br />
Dekha hai teer chalte masoom ke gale pe<br />
Ab maajra hai kya mera baba kaha'n gaya</p>

<p>6. <b>Mirza o Meer</b> tumne tahreer jo kiya hai<br />
is gham se <b>Asghari</b> me nouha buka fugaa'n hai<br />
Bacchi ka poochna mera baba kaha'n gaya</p>

